<br class="ltx_break">   "description": "The retinal fundus image shows several microaneurysms and dot hemorrhages primarily located in the central region. There are no visible hard exudates, cotton wool spots, or signs of neovascularization. The optic disc appears normal, and there is no evidence of venous beading or significant venous changes.", 
<br class="ltx_break">   "referral": 1, 
<br class="ltx_break">   "score": 40 
<br class="ltx_break"> } 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></p>
